# Build output — generated by `npm run build` (tsc + scripts/build-client.mjs).
#
# Deliberately NOT committed: lib/client.js is an esbuild bundle that inlines
# three shims and a Buffer polyfill, so a checked-in copy is a second source of
# truth that drifts from src/. Both `prepack` and `prepare` build it, so every
# legitimate consumption path (npm publish, git-URL install, local clone) gets a
# bundle that matches the source it was built from. A stale lib/ is what made
# the original base64url defect survive a "passing" test run.
lib/

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Packed artifacts
dist/
*.tgz

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
